.TH BTK-BALANCE 1 "16 August 2026" "Bitcoin Toolkit 4.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
btk-balance \- local address \-> satoshi index
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B btk balance
.br
.B btk balance \-\-sync
[\fB\-\-host\fR \fIH\fR]
[\fB\-\-port\fR \fIP\fR]
[\fB\-\-rpc-auth\fR \fIuser:pass\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Query a local address-to-satoshi index, or synchronize it from Bitcoin Core
JSON-RPC.
.PP
Query is a transformer on stdin. Items are typed
.B address
or
.B balance
objects, or a bare Base58Check / bech32 address. Missing addresses print
.BR sats
0. A leftover positional is
.BR "provide input on stdin" .
The index always lives at
.IR ~/.btk/balance .
.PP
.B \-\-sync
creates the index if it does not exist and catches it up if it does.
.B \-\-force
wipes the directory and walks from genesis.
A reorg is
.BR "reorg detected; rebuild with --sync --force" .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show this help and exit.
.TP
.B \-\-sync
Walk Core JSON-RPC
.RB ( getblock
hex). First run walks 0..tip. Later runs walk from the stored tip.
.TP
.B \-\-force
Only with
.BR \-\-sync .
Wipe
.I ~/.btk/balance
and walk from genesis.
.TP
.BI \-\-host " H"
RPC host. Default 127.0.0.1, or
.B rpc.host
in config. A
.I host:port
form sets the port.
.TP
.BI \-\-port " P"
RPC port. Default 8332, or
.B rpc.port
in config.
.TP
.BI \-\-rpc-auth " user:pass"
HTTP Basic credentials. Default
.B rpc.auth
in config. No cookie file.
.TP
.B \-\-from address
Force bare stdin lines to be parsed as addresses.
.TP
.BI \-\-config " PATH"
Config file. Default
.B $BTK_CONFIG
if set, else
.IR ~/.btk/config.json .
.TP
.BI \-\-out " ndjson|json|plain"
Output framing. Default ndjson.
.B \-\-out plain
prints the satoshi count.
.TP
.BI \-\-in " auto|ndjson|json|plain"
Stdin framing. Default auto.
.SH OUTPUT
.BR type=balance ,
.BR address ,
.BR sats .
Progress is on stderr.
.SH NOTES
Requires LevelDB at compile time. Mainnet only. Does not read Core's chainstate.
.B \-\-path ,
.BR \-\-build ,
.BR \-\-update ,
.BR \-\-from-rpc ,
and
.B \-\-from-chainstate
are unknown.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR btk (1)
